itude.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,true,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('q-map-hemisphere-hunt',9,'boolean','area distortion at high latitudes is the main classroom caution of Mercator projection classroom issue.','Mercator inflates areas toward the poles.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,true,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('q-map-hemisphere-hunt',10,'boolean','south of the Equator is the definition of Southern Hemisphere.','The Southern Hemisphere lies south of the Equator.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,true,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('q-map-legend-logic',1,'boolean','connects Atlantic and Pacific is the function of The Panama Canal relative to the Americas.','The canal links the Caribbean/Atlantic side with the Pacific.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,true,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('q-map-legend-logic',2,'boolean','an intercardinal direction is the classification of Northeast.','Northeast lies between north and east.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,true,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('q-map-legend-logic',3,'boolean','one topic is the emphasis of A thematic map.','Thematic maps show a theme such as climate or population.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,true,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('q-map-legend-logic',4,'boolean','elevated flat land is the definition of A plateau.','A plateau is a raised area of relatively flat land.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,true,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('q-map-legend-logic',5,'boolean','about 66.5°S is the latitude band of Antarctic Circle.','The Antarctic Circle is the northern limit of the midnight sun in the south.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,true,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('q-map-legend-logic',6,'boolean','borders and countries is the emphasis of A political map.','Political maps emphasise states and boundaries.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,true,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('q-map-legend-logic',7,'boolean','land almost surrounded by water is the definition of A peninsula.','A peninsula is land projecting into water and joined to a mainland.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,true,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,