inition of A gulf.','A gulf is a large inlet of a sea or ocean.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,true,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('q-map-pinpoint-practice',8,'boolean','South Asia is the location of The Himalaya on a map.','The Himalaya arc along the southern edge of the Tibetan Plateau.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,true,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('q-map-pinpoint-practice',9,'boolean','latitude and longitude is the what they report of GPS coordinates.','Common GPS readouts pair latitude and longitude.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,true,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),('q-map-pinpoint-practice',10,'boolean','east–west is the direction they run of Latitude lines.','Parallels of latitude run east–west and measure north–south position.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,true,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL) on conflict (quiz_id, position) do nothing;